# MyPackage

A custom, installable Python package.

## Installation

### 1. Local Installation (Development / Direct)
Open your terminal in this directory and run:
```bash
pip install .
```

Or for editable mode (changes to code apply immediately without re-installing):
```bash
pip install -e .
```

### 2. Install directly from GitHub
Once pushed to GitHub, anyone can install it on their computer using:
```bash
pip install git+https://github.com/your-username/mypackage.git
```

## Usage

### Import in Python
```python
import mypackage

# Greet user
print(mypackage.greet("Alice"))

# Add numbers
print(mypackage.add_numbers(10, 20))
```

### Command Line Utility
```bash
mypackage-cli
```
